{"id":48921,"date":"2026-02-12T20:27:09","date_gmt":"2026-02-12T19:27:09","guid":{"rendered":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-lisboa-ponte-vasco-da-gama\/"},"modified":"2026-09-20T19:08:05","modified_gmt":"2026-09-20T18:08:05","slug":"meia-maratona-lisboa-ponte-vasco-da-gama","status":"publish","type":"ajde_events","link":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/eventos\/meia-maratona-lisboa-ponte-vasco-da-gama\/","title":{"rendered":"Meia Maratona Lisboa 2026 \u2013 Ponte Vasco da Gama"},"content":{"rendered":"<style>.event_description, .eventcard, .evo_eventcard, .pr-page-wrapper { height: auto !important; max-height: none !important; overflow: visible !important; }<\/style>\n<p><!-- CARD 1: DESCRI\u00c7\u00c3O GERAL --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 16px;\">Sobre <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Meia Maratona Lisboa 2026 \u2013 Ponte Vasco da Gama<\/span><\/h2>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 16px;\">A <strong>Meia Maratona Lisboa 2026 \u2013 Ponte Vasco da Gama<\/strong> (Hyundai Meia Maratona) realiza-se no <strong>Domingo, 11 de Outubro de 2026<\/strong>, consagrando-se como uma das experi\u00eancias mais fascinantes do atletismo europeu ao permitir cruzar a correr o tabuleiro suspenso da imponente <strong>Ponte Vasco da Gama<\/strong> sobre o Rio Tejo.<\/p>\n<p style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.7; margin-bottom: 0;\">Organizada pelo prestigiado <strong>Maratona Clube de Portugal<\/strong> em paralelo com a EDP Maratona de Lisboa, o evento conta com a r\u00e1pida <strong>Meia Maratona (21,097 km)<\/strong> com tiro de partida \u00e0s <strong>09:20<\/strong> e a participativa <strong>EDP 8K (8 km)<\/strong>. Ambas as provas partem em simult\u00e2neo da ponte e culminam numa apote\u00f3tica meta instalada na hist\u00f3rica <strong>Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio<\/strong> em <strong>Lisboa<\/strong>, contando com transporte gratuito de autocarro para a partida a partir da Gare do Oriente.<\/p>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 2: FICHA T\u00c9CNICA \/ SNAPSHOT --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.25); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u26a1 Ficha <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">T\u00e9cnica \/ Snapshot<\/span><\/h2>\n<ul class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-grid\" style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(240px, 1fr)); gap: 16px; width: 100%; box-sizing: border-box; list-style: none; padding: 0; margin: 0;\">\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Data &#038; Hor\u00e1rio<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">11 de Outubro de 2026 \u00e0s 09:20<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Local, Concelho &#038; Distrito<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Lisboa<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Dist\u00e2ncias<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Hyundai Meia Maratona (21,097 km) e EDP 8K (8 km)<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.02); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Entidade Organizadora<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\">Maratona Clube de Portugal<\/span><\/li>\n<li class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-item\" style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 4px; width: 100%; min-width: 0; box-sizing: border-box; background: rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.08); border: 1px solid rgba(139, 92, 246, 0.3); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px;\"><strong class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-label\" style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px;\">Regulamento Oficial<\/strong><span class=\"pr-tech-snapshot-val\" style=\"font-size: 15px; font-weight: 600; word-break: break-word; overflow-wrap: anywhere; min-width: 0; display: block;\"><a href=\"https:\/\/maratonaclubedeportugal.com\/en\/regulamento-hyundai-meia-maratona-out2026-pt\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" style=\"color: #38BDF8; text-decoration: none; display: inline-flex; align-items: center; gap: 6px;\"><br \/>\n                    \ud83d\udcc4 Consultar Regulamento Oficial &rarr;<br \/>\n                <\/a><\/span><\/li>\n<div style=\"grid-column: 1 \/ -1; margin-top: 8px;\"><strong style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 12px; text-transform: uppercase; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block; margin-bottom: 10px;\">\ud83c\udfc3 Programa de Provas &#038; Sub-eventos<\/strong><\/p>\n<div style=\"display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(260px, 1fr)); gap: 12px;\">\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Meia-Maratona<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">Hyundai Meia Maratona de Lisboa<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:20 \u2022 Percurso R\u00e1pido com Travessia da Ponte Vasco da Gama<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"text-align: right; background: rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.08); padding: 6px 12px; border-radius: 10px; border: 1px solid rgba(52, 211, 153, 0.2);\">\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">1\u00aa Fase (at\u00e9 1.600 inscritos):<\/strong> 35.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (Primeiros 1.600)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">2\u00aa Fase (1.601 a 4.800):<\/strong> 55.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (At\u00e9 4.800 inscritos)<\/span><\/div>\n<div style=\"color: #34D399; font-size: 12px; line-height: 1.4;\"><strong style=\"color: #A7F3D0;\">3\u00aa Fase (a partir de 4.800):<\/strong> 70.00 \u20ac<span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 11px;\"> (At\u00e9 esgotar)<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<div style=\"background: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.03); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; padding: 14px 16px; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap;\">\n<div><span style=\"color: #C4B5FD; font-size: 11px; text-transform: uppercase; font-weight: 700; letter-spacing: 0.5px; display: block;\">Corrida Curta \/ Prova Aberta<\/span><strong style=\"color: #F8FAFC; font-size: 15px;\">EDP 8K<\/strong><span style=\"color: #94A3B8; font-size: 13px; display: block; margin-top: 2px;\">\ud83d\udcc5 11 Out \u2022 \u23f0 Partida: 09:20 \u2022 Travessia Pedonal da Ponte Vasco da Gama<\/span><\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/div>\n<\/ul>\n<\/div>\n<p><!-- CARD 3: PERGUNTAS FREQUENTES (FAQS) --><\/p>\n<div class=\"pr-content-card\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 20px; padding: 28px; margin-bottom: 24px;\">\n<h2 class=\"pr-card-title\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-size: 22px; font-weight: 700; margin-bottom: 20px;\">\u2753 Perguntas <span class=\"pr-gradient-text\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(135deg, #C4B5FD 20%, #8B5CF6 100%); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\">Frequentes (FAQ)<\/span><\/h2>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da Hyundai Meia Maratona 2026?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A prova realiza-se no Domingo, 11 de Outubro de 2026, com tiro de partida \u00e0s 09:20 tanto para a Meia Maratona (21,097 km) como para a EDP 8K.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Como se acede ao local de partida na Ponte Vasco da Gama?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O acesso \u00e0 partida \u00e9 feito exclusivamente atrav\u00e9s dos autocarros gratuitos assegurados pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o, que partem da Gare do Oriente (junto ao C.C. Vasco da Gama) entre as 06:30 e as 07:30 para atletas munidos do dorsal oficial.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde fica instalada a meta da Meia Maratona?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">A meta de consagra\u00e7\u00e3o de ambas as dist\u00e2ncias fica instalada na Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio, no cora\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rico de Lisboa junto ao Rio Tejo.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Onde e quando \u00e9 efetuada a entrega dos dorsais?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">O levantamento dos kits de atleta e dorsais decorre na Sport Expo, na FIL (Feira Internacional de Lisboa &#8211; Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es), nos dias 8, 9 e 10 de Outubro, das 10:00 \u00e0s 20:00.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<details class=\"pr-faq-item\" style=\"background: rgba(30, 41, 59, 0.35); border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.08); border-radius: 12px; margin-bottom: 12px; padding: 16px 20px;\">\n<summary class=\"pr-faq-question\" style=\"color: #FFFFFF; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; cursor: pointer;\">Esta Meia Maratona integra o circuito SuperHalfs?<\/summary>\n<div class=\"pr-faq-answer\" style=\"color: #CBD5E1; font-size: 15px; line-height: 1.6; margin-top: 12px;\">N\u00e3o. A Hyundai Meia Maratona da Ponte Vasco da Gama (Outubro) n\u00e3o integra a s\u00e9rie SuperHalfs; a prova do circuito \u00e9 a EDP Meia Maratona de Lisboa (Mar\u00e7o), que atravessa a Ponte 25 de Abril.<\/div>\n<\/details>\n<\/div>\n<p><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"SportsEvent\", \"name\": \"Meia Maratona Lisboa 2026 \u2013 Ponte Vasco da Gama\", \"startDate\": \"2026-10-11\", \"eventAttendanceMode\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/OfflineEventAttendanceMode\", \"eventStatus\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\/EventScheduled\", \"location\": {\"@type\": \"Place\", \"name\": \"Lisboa\", \"address\": {\"@type\": \"PostalAddress\", \"addressLocality\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressRegion\": \"Lisboa\", \"addressCountry\": \"PT\"}}, \"organizer\": {\"@type\": \"Organization\", \"name\": \"Maratona Clube de Portugal\"}}<\/script><script type=\"application\/ld+json\" data-no-optimize=\"1\">{\"@context\": \"https:\/\/schema.org\", \"@type\": \"FAQPage\", \"mainEntity\": [{\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Qual \u00e9 a data e o hor\u00e1rio de partida da Hyundai Meia Maratona 2026?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A prova realiza-se no Domingo, 11 de Outubro de 2026, com tiro de partida \u00e0s 09:20 tanto para a Meia Maratona (21,097 km) como para a EDP 8K.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Como se acede ao local de partida na Ponte Vasco da Gama?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O acesso \u00e0 partida \u00e9 feito exclusivamente atrav\u00e9s dos autocarros gratuitos assegurados pela organiza\u00e7\u00e3o, que partem da Gare do Oriente (junto ao C.C. Vasco da Gama) entre as 06:30 e as 07:30 para atletas munidos do dorsal oficial.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde fica instalada a meta da Meia Maratona?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"A meta de consagra\u00e7\u00e3o de ambas as dist\u00e2ncias fica instalada na Pra\u00e7a do Com\u00e9rcio, no cora\u00e7\u00e3o hist\u00f3rico de Lisboa junto ao Rio Tejo.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Onde e quando \u00e9 efetuada a entrega dos dorsais?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"O levantamento dos kits de atleta e dorsais decorre na Sport Expo, na FIL (Feira Internacional de Lisboa - Parque das Na\u00e7\u00f5es), nos dias 8, 9 e 10 de Outubro, das 10:00 \u00e0s 20:00.\"}}, {\"@type\": \"Question\", \"name\": \"Esta Meia Maratona integra o circuito SuperHalfs?\", \"acceptedAnswer\": {\"@type\": \"Answer\", \"text\": \"N\u00e3o. A Hyundai Meia Maratona da Ponte Vasco da Gama (Outubro) n\u00e3o integra a s\u00e9rie SuperHalfs; a prova do circuito \u00e9 a EDP Meia Maratona de Lisboa (Mar\u00e7o), que atravessa a Ponte 25 de Abril.\"}}]}<\/script><\/p>\n","protected":false},"author":1,"featured_media":68071,"menu_order":0,"comment_status":"open","ping_status":"closed","template":"","meta":{"_acf_changed":false},"tags":[],"event_type":[27,478,41],"event_type_2":[33,727,820],"event_type_3":[],"event_type_4":[],"event_type_5":[],"class_list":["post-48921","ajde_events","type-ajde_events","status-publish","has-post-thumbnail","hentry","event_location-lisboa","event_type-corrida","event_type-corridas-inferior-10","event_type-meiamaratona","event_type_2-lisboa","event_type_2-lisboa-e-centro","event_type_2-portugal"],"acf":[],"featured_image_src":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-content\/uploads\/2026\/09\/cartaz-meia-maratona-lisboa-ponte-vasco-da-gama-2.webp","ams_acf":[],"_links":{"self":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/48921","targetHints":{"allow":["GET"]}}],"collection":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events"}],"about":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/types\/ajde_events"}],"author":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/users\/1"}],"replies":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/comments?post=48921"}],"version-history":[{"count":5,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/48921\/revisions"}],"predecessor-version":[{"id":68062,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/ajde_events\/48921\/revisions\/68062"}],"wp:featuredmedia":[{"embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media\/68071"}],"wp:attachment":[{"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/wp-json\/wp\/v2\/media?parent=48921"}],"wp:term":[{"taxonomy":"post_tag","embeddable":true,"href":"https:\/\/www.portugalrunning.com\/w